    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Runic Prophecy is a third-person, souls-like action RPG,\u00a0 set in the shattered world of Eyjusheim.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a mighty and prosperous kingdom, Eyjusheim now lingers as a shadow of its former self. A cataclysmic event brought the empire to its knees, tearing it apart along with its legendary dragon lords. All that remains are scattered islands drifting through an endless void, remnants of a world that once was.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you, alongside your dragon companion, have the strength to restore Eyjusheim to its former glory and reignite a shattered world? </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>7 levels</strong> across mythic and diverse landscapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find, ride, and customize powerful dragons. Overcome enemy defenses with <strong>tactical strategy</strong> and <strong>destructive force</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a <strong>story-rich adventure</strong> with cutscenes and deep lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in <strong>challenging real-time combat</strong> against different <strong>enemy types</strong> and <strong>9 powerful bosses</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master <strong>7 distinct weapon classes</strong>, each with upgrade paths and unique playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash powerful abilities through a <strong>mystical rune magic system</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your hero with advanced character customization and stat allocation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a <strong>semi-open world</strong> full of secrets, optional paths, and hidden lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find loot, upgrade your gear and runes, and interact with <strong>vendors and skill trainers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive with <strong>potions</strong>, <strong>resource management</strong>, and <strong>adaptive strategy</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a <strong>dark fantasy world</strong> with elements inspired by <strong>Norse mythology</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Runic Prophecy is a third-person, souls-like action RPG,\u00a0 set in the shattered world of Eyjusheim.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a mighty and prosperous kingdom, Eyjusheim now lingers as a shadow of its former self. A cataclysmic event brought the empire to its knees, tearing it apart along with its legendary dragon lords. All that remains are scattered islands drifting through an endless void, remnants of a world that once was.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you, alongside your dragon companion, have the strength to restore Eyjusheim to its former glory and reignite a shattered world? </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>7 levels</strong> across mythic and diverse landscapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find, ride, and customize powerful dragons. Overcome enemy defenses with <strong>tactical strategy</strong> and <strong>destructive force</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a <strong>story-rich adventure</strong> with cutscenes and deep lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in <strong>challenging real-time combat</strong> against different <strong>enemy types</strong> and <strong>9 powerful bosses</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master <strong>7 distinct weapon classes</strong>, each with upgrade paths and unique playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash powerful abilities through a <strong>mystical rune magic system</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your hero with advanced character customization and stat allocation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a <strong>semi-open world</strong> full of secrets, optional paths, and hidden lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find loot, upgrade your gear and runes, and interact with <strong>vendors and skill trainers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive with <strong>potions</strong>, <strong>resource management</strong>, and <strong>adaptive strategy</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a <strong>dark fantasy world</strong> with elements inspired by <strong>Norse mythology</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Runic Prophecy is a challenging third-person soulslike action RPG set in a dark fantasy world. Explore Eyjusheim, unleash magic and a dragon in combat, battle supernatural creatures, and uncover the hidden lore of a shattered world.",
